<h2>Alpine-grade, not alpine-priced</h2>
<p>Whistler properties ask more of a sauna than most places. Heavy snow on the roof, temperatures that drop hard, UV that breaks down finishes faster than you'd expect. We build for those conditions because the Sea-to-Sky is where we live.</p>
<p>Our builds use full insulation (R-13+ walls), proper vapor barriers, and drainage designed for the amount of moisture this corridor throws around. Wood-fired or electric, residential or commercial. We've built for lodges and we've built for backyards.</p>
<p>We're based in Squamish, 45 minutes south. We come to you for site assessment and delivery. No shipping company involved.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set local_content %}
<h2>Whistler and Pemberton</h2>
<p>We've delivered to Pemberton as well. The corridor from Squamish north is our backyard and we don't charge extra to drive up the highway.</p>
<p>If you're building at a resort property or a residential lot with access constraints, <a href="/contact/" class="link--accent-underline">talk to us early</a>. Site logistics in Whistler deserve a conversation before we quote.</p>
